  /Subject (La R\351galante is a recent cycle route linking Nantes to Mont-Saint-Michel through the heart of the countryside. Its 275 km, split into 9 stages, mostly follow greenways with very little climbing and pass through historic towns.) /Title (La R\351galante \205 Route sheet | Bike'N Tour) /Trapped /False
